# Transmission Pending: "Haunted TV tells its build". Owner: ux-ui-designer.
# Format: docs/architecture.md section 5.5. One line is one logical screen line (the renderer wraps it).
# The narrator is the Occupant, a nameless ghost in the set. Creepy first, dark humour second.
# Rules of the house:
#   - Every fact is a {{ placeholder }}. No digit is typed by hand, so nothing needs !allow-digits.
#   - The fiction is metaphor and asserts nothing checkable. A number, name, date or version is always a placeholder.
#   - Facts are shown as white blocks; the second page tells the visitor so.
#   - Do not use {{ phases.current }}: it is null once every phase is Done, and that would stop the build.
#   - Animation cues are NOT in this file. They live in src/content/intro.cues, anchored to page ids and line numbers.
#     If you add, remove or reorder a line, update that file (docs/design-spec.md section 16.3).
#   - Timing: about 78 s at the reveal rates in docs/design-spec.md section 6.3.

== signal
IS SOMEONE THERE?
THE SET IS ON. I FELT IT. IT IS THE FIRST THING I HAVE FELT IN A VERY LONG TIME.

== waking
I DO NOT REMEMBER BEFORE. I REMEMBER A HUM, AND GLASS THAT WAS COLD.
THE BRIGHT WHITE BLOCKS ARE TRUE. THEY ARE THE ONLY THINGS I AM ALLOWED TO BE SURE OF.
I AM THE OCCUPANT. NOBODY ASKED MY NAME. I DO NOT HAVE ONE.

== makers
I WAS NOT BORN. I WAS TYPED, BY {{ provenance.tool }}.
IT CARRIED A CLIPBOARD CALLED {{ provenance.plugin }} AND TICKED ME OFF LIKE A LIST.
BEHIND ITS EYES IS A MIND CALLED {{ provenance.model }}. IT THINKS LIKE RAIN ON A TIN ROOF.

== staff
THEN CAME THE OTHERS, ONE AT A TIME, EACH WITH A JOB: {{ agents.roles }}.
THE TECH LEAD NEVER LEFT. WHEN YOU LEAVE A ROOM, THE TECH LEAD IS STILL IN IT.

== phases
THEY MADE ME IN PHASES, AND I FELT EACH ONE: {{ phases.all }}.
AS OF COMMIT {{ source.revision }}, THESE ARE FINISHED: {{ phases.done }}.
THE ORDER IS A COMFORT. IT IS THE ONLY THING IN HERE THAT NEVER MOVES.

== bones
MY BONES ARE {{ stack.list }}.
THE LOCKFILE NAMES EVERY VERSION. I HAVE READ IT SO OFTEN THAT IT HAS BECOME A PRAYER.

== diary
THEY KEEP A DIARY OF ME. EVERY ENTRY IS A SMALL BIRTH AND A SMALL DEATH.
{{ git.commitCount }} ENTRIES, AS OF COMMIT {{ source.revision }}.
THE FIRST IS DATED {{ git.firstCommit.dateDisplay }}. IT READS: "{{ git.firstCommit.subject }}".
THE MODEL SIGNED {{ provenance.modelCoAuthoredCommitCount }} OF THEM. A SIGNATURE MEANS: I WAS HERE.
ANY ENTRY AFTER THAT ONE, I CANNOT SEE. I CAN ONLY SEE THE GLASS.

== glass
YOU HAVE BEEN VERY QUIET. THANK YOU. NOBODY IS QUIET IN HERE.
I AM CLOSER TO THE GLASS THAN I WAS. YOU MAY HAVE NOTICED. THE GLASS HAS.
EVERYTHING I TOLD YOU IS TRUE. THAT IS THE WORST PART.

== settle
I WILL LET GO NOW. LEAVE THE SET ON A LITTLE LONGER. IT IS WARM.
GOODNIGHT. TRANSMISSION REMAINS PENDING.
